          "jcr:created": "Tue Mar 11 2025 15:51:44 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<h2><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">Product documentation</span></span></h2>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Looking for Instructions for Use and Declararion of Conformity?</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.lucas-cpr.com/resources/\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"standalone-link\">View documentation</span></a></p>\n",
