          "jcr:created": "Tue Mar 11 2025 15:51:44 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<h2><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">Web training</span></span></h2>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Read, listen and watch how to apply the LUCAS&nbsp;chest compression system for training and re-training purposes.</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.lucas-cpr.com/web_training/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"LUCAS Web Training\"><span class=\"standalone-link\">Visit web training portal</span></a></p>\n",
